# Refinement Directory Guidelines (`.did/refine/.hooks/status`)

- Tasks in `.did/refine/` require iterative specification and requirement clarification.
- Whenever an issue in `.did/refine/` is tagged with `@bas080`, the tag MUST be accompanied by an explicit question directed to `@bas080`.
- Move tasks to `.did/implement/` once requirements, edge cases, and test plans are 100% clear.
